### separation
  quietest mechanism: 2 content tokens
  loudest relabel:    0 content tokens
  misclassified:      0 of 18
  the two populations are separated, and any floor in (0, 2] works

### CONTROL. The stripper must actually strip, and must not strip everything.
  a clause of pure notation vocabulary -> [] (must be empty)
  a clause of pure content            -> ["rescale", "denominated", "lanes"] (must be 3)
  controls held.
